      "writtenOn": "2012-10-10T19:17:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually I changed check_keys_changed() to tell us if keys have changed, not just if they are pressed. The reason was to move board_interrupt_host() so it\u0027s no longer nested in the scan loop.\n\nThe idea was to avoid interrupting the host while we\u0027re in the scan loop, but in practice it only helps the case when all keys are released since any keys held will cause us to re-enter the loop.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAQX///6g\u003d",
      "revId": "e1ec457ad1fd64d64972f43840846ad0e6b1c8bf",
