      "writtenOn": "2012-10-10T19:17:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, nice catch! In this code if we break to interrupt the host, then we don\u0027t delay before doing another scan. That\u0027s broken.\n\nI think the right solution is to calculate wait_time before breaking if (keys_changed). That way:\n- If we enter the loop as a result of a keyboard interrupt, we scan immediately.\n- If a change is seen and we break to interrupt the host, then we delay when we fall back into the loop.\n\nLMK what you think",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAQX///6M\u003d",
      "revId": "e1ec457ad1fd64d64972f43840846ad0e6b1c8bf",
